        <body>
            <div xml:id="d297-a1">

                <pb facs="0419" n="411" xml:id="pg411"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Annex 1]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">
                        British Draft Memorandum to the Japanese Government
                    </hi><anchor n="66" xml:id="d297-f1"/>
                </head>
                <p>His Majesty’s Government are aware of the communication which President Roosevelt
                    made to the Japanese Ambassador on August 17th<anchor n="67" xml:id="d297-f2"/>
                    regarding the concern of the United States at Japanese military activities in
                    Indo-China and the steps which the United States Government would be compelled
                    to take if the Japanese Government pursued a similar policy in regard to
                    neighbouring countries. His Majesty’s Government shares the concern of the
                    United States Government and cannot disregard [the] plain threat to the security
                    of British territories, which such a policy on the part of Japan would
                    constitute.</p>
                <p>His Majesty’s Government therefore, who have for their part no aggressive
                    intentions either against countries bordering on British territories or against
                    Japan herself, feel it necessary in the interest of peace to let the Japanese
                    Government know that any further Japanese encroachment in the South-West Pacific
                    area would compel His Majesty’s Government to take counter measures even though
                    these might lead to war between Great Britain and Japan.</p>
                <closer><dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <date calendar="gregorian" when="1941-08-29"><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >August</hi> 29, 1941</date>.</dateline></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
